sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Alert
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant G as Grafana MCP
  participant C as Coordinator
  participant S as On-call channel
  A->>O: alert, timestamp, service context
  O->>O: persist bounded plan
  par metrics and logs
    O->>G: typed metrics tool call
    G-->>O: cited metrics finding
  and
    O->>G: typed Loki tool call
    G-->>O: cited log finding
  end
  O->>C: structured evidence only
  C->>S: proposal, confidence, alternatives
  S-->>O: explicit operator action
